MRSA is super-critical (φ̂=𐑣) with fast kinetics (K=𐑺) — runaway replication plus antibiotic resistance. DARPin against PBP2a demotes φ̂; biofilm disruptor restores normal disjunctive composition.

[1m[35mStructural Strategy:[0m
  Dual MEET: DARPin_PBP2a targets resistance mechanism (φ̂); Biofilm Disruptor breaks quorum-sensing architecture (ɢ)

[1m[35mComponents (2):[0m

  [1m1. DARPin_PBP2a[0m
     Target: φ̂
     Operation: [36mMEET[0m
     Mechanism: PBP2a is the resistance protein — DARPin binding forces φ̂ demotion from 𐑣→⊙

  [1m2. Biofilm Disruptor[0m
     Target: ∋
     Operation: [36mMEET[0m
     Mechanism: Biofilm EPS matrix disruption converts ɢ from SEQ(𐑠) to OR(𐑜) — individual cells become vulnerable

